WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
Scene one.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:06.003
The guide's Step 1 sets four things once:
the hierarchy settings, the initiatives

3
00:00:06.003 --> 00:00:10.975
in audit at the intermediate root, platform
logs, and Defender for Cloud plans.

4
00:00:10.975 --> 00:00:15.497
Microsoft Learn gives the commands,
and its REST reference gives the reads,

5
00:00:15.497 --> 00:00:19.362
but nobody runs them back every
week across every subscription.

6
00:00:19.362 --> 00:00:23.188
So the kit does, with one check
scoped to the intermediate root.

7
00:00:23.188 --> 00:00:25.363
For our portal, two things turn up.

8
00:00:25.363 --> 00:00:28.526
Its subscription's Key Vault
plan is on the Free tier.

9
00:00:28.526 --> 00:00:31.691
And the hub firewall's public
address does send logs,

10
00:00:31.691 --> 00:00:35.225
but to an application team's
workspace, which doesn't count:

11
00:00:35.225 --> 00:00:39.340
a log counts only if it's enabled
and goes to the platform workspace.
